[Desktop Entry]
Name=Lock & Unlock
Name[de]=Sperren & Entsperren
Name[fr]=Verrouillage et déverrouillage
Name[es]=Bloqueo y desbloqueo
Name[it]=Blocco e sblocco
Name[pt]=Bloqueio e desbloqueio
Name[nl]=Vergrendelen en ontgrendelen
Name[pl]=Blokowanie i odblokowywanie
Name[ru]=Блокировка и разблокировка
Comment=Password, pattern, fingerprint, face and when the screen locks
Comment[de]=Passwort, Muster, Fingerabdruck, Gesicht und wann der Bildschirm sperrt
Comment[fr]=Mot de passe, schéma, empreinte, visage et moment du verrouillage
Comment[es]=Contraseña, patrón, huella, rostro y cuándo se bloquea la pantalla
Comment[it]=Password, sequenza, impronta, volto e quando si blocca lo schermo
Comment[pt]=Palavra-passe, padrão, impressão digital, rosto e quando o ecrã bloqueia
Comment[nl]=Wachtwoord, patroon, vingerafdruk, gezicht en wanneer het scherm vergrendelt
Comment[pl]=Hasło, wzór, odcisk palca, twarz i moment blokady ekranu
Comment[ru]=Пароль, графический ключ, отпечаток, лицо и время блокировки экрана
Exec=gnome-control-center lock
Icon=org.gnome.Settings-screen-lock-symbolic
Terminal=false
Type=Application
NoDisplay=true
StartupNotify=true
Categories=GNOME;GTK;Settings;X-GNOME-Settings-Panel;X-GNOME-DetailsSettings;
OnlyShowIn=GNOME;Unity;
Keywords=Lock;Unlock;Screen;PIN;Password;Pattern;Fingerprint;Face;Security;
Keywords[de]=Sperren;Entsperren;Bildschirm;Sperrbildschirm;PIN;Passwort;Muster;Fingerabdruck;Gesicht;Sicherheit;
